ard", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tsp", "item": "dijon mustard", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 9, "raw": "2 tablespoons tarragon vinegar", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "tarragon vinegar", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 10, "raw": "¼ cup water-packed canned tuna, drained and diced", "group": null, "quantity": 0.25, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "water-packed canned tuna", "preparation": "drained and diced", "optional": false}, {"position": 11, "raw": "2 tablespoons sour pickles, diced", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "sour pickles", "preparation": "diced", "optional": false}, {"position": 12, "raw": "1 teaspoon fresh tarragon, chopped", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tsp", "item": "fresh tarragon", "preparation": "chopped", "optional": false}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "Toss the vegetables with the white-wine vinegar and ½cup olive oil, season and let sit for 1 hour."}, {"position": 2, "text": "For the vinaigrette, mash the yolks of the eggs through a fine sieve into a bowl. Blend in the anchovy paste and whisk in ¼cup olive oil, stirring until smooth. Add the mustard, tarragon vinegar, tuna, pickles, egg whites and tarragon."}, {"position": 3, "text": "Drain the vegetables of excess marinade, place in a bowl, dress with the vinaigrette and mix lightly."}], "nutrition": {"calories": 324.7, "protein_g": 7.6, "carbohydrates_g": 4.3, "fat_g": 31.0, "saturated_fat_g": 5.0, "trans_fat_g": 0.0, "cholesterol_mg": 139.0, "sodium_mg": 301.7, "fiber_g": 0.9, "sugar_g": 0.8, "unsaturated_fat_g": 24.9, "source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": [], "diet": [], "course": [], "meal": [], "occasion": [], "other": ["beet", "marinate", "potato", "salad"]}, "images": [], "rating": {"average": 3.0, "count": 13}, "v